# Utiliza un laboratorio aislado con datos sintéticos y reemplaza las variables.
# El recorrido automatizado prepara el prestador y controla el reloj en PHPUnit.
# En el cliente HTTP, usa IDs, versión, fecha disponible y tokens de ese laboratorio.
# Conserva cada UUID para repetir la misma intención. Cambia los UUID para una prueba nueva.
@base = https://tekora-mobile-lab.example.test/api/v1
@email = solicitante@example.test
@password = synthetic-lab-password
@registration = PEGAR_CODIGO_OPACO
@recovery = PEGAR_CODIGO_DE_RECUPERACION
@bearer = PEGAR_TOKEN_SANCTUM
@service = 21
@provider = 7
@slug = soporte-tecnico
@inquiry = 92
@quote = 76c6309a-4b48-4ea5-a965-9335f1ba9768
@reservation = 14
@review = 19
@readToken = PEGAR_EL_META_READ_TOKEN_DE_LA_PAGINA
@noticeSource = inquiry
@noticeId = 2
@slotDate = 2030-01-07
@slotTime = 09:00
@availabilityRevision = 1
@reservationVersion = 1
@messageKey = c02c9803-3da0-4621-a697-87a1d808c28a
@quoteKey = 75ea529c-5112-46ea-9cf2-490a40e81e18
@proposalKey = e8ca8eb3-367a-42b7-923c-6549dfaae9eb
@commitKey = 37ac71d7-9ea5-4dbf-996f-3ee5b7003331

### Registro · 202 neutral
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}"}

### Confirmar registro con el código completo · 202
POST {{base}}/auth/register/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","token":"{{registration}}","name":"Solicitante de prueba","age":30,"gender":"Prefiero no decirlo","password":"{{password}}","password_confirmation":"{{password}}"}

### Inicio de sesión · 201, copiar data.access_token para las peticiones privadas
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}","device_name":"Android de laboratorio"}

### Sesión y perfil
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{base}}/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Cambiar nombre
PATCH {{base}}/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Solicitante M3.1"}

### Subir foto propia con un PNG sintético local
POST {{base}}/me/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=tekora-m31-test

--tekora-m31-test
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="foto-sintetica.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./foto-sintetica.png
--tekora-m31-test--

### Descargar foto propia · bytes de imagen o 404
GET {{base}}/me/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}

### Inicio
GET {{base}}/me/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Catálogo y prestador
GET {{base}}/categories
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{base}}/services?category={{slug}}&modality=remote&q=computadora&page=1&per_page=12
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{base}}/services/{{service}}
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{base}}/providers/{{provider}}
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{base}}/providers/{{provider}}/services?page=1&per_page=12
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{base}}/providers/{{provider}}/reviews?page=1
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{base}}/services/{{service}}/availability
Accept: application/json

### Abrir solicitud · 201 inicial, 200 si ya está activa
POST {{base}}/services/{{service}}/inquiries
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Necesito un diagnóstico de mi computadora."}

### Seguir solicitud · el prestador acepta previamente en web
GET {{base}}/inquiries/{{inquiry}}/journey
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Enviar mensaje · repetir con el mismo cuerpo y UUID si se pierde la respuesta
POST {{base}}/inquiries/{{inquiry}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"¿Qué detalles necesitas del equipo?","idempotency_key":"{{messageKey}}"}

### Leer la página después de que el prestador responda en web
GET {{base}}/inquiries/{{inquiry}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Confirmar solo la página mostrada cuando meta.read_token esté presente
POST {{base}}/inquiries/{{inquiry}}/messages/read
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"read_token":"{{readToken}}"}

### Cotizaciones · una emisión inicial o repetida con el mismo UUID devuelve 200
GET {{base}}/inquiries/{{inquiry}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{base}}/inquiries/{{inquiry}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"idempotency_key":"{{quoteKey}}"}

### Contrastar importe y aceptar
GET {{base}}/quotes/{{quote}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{base}}/quotes/{{quote}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"acknowledge":true}

### Horarios · obtener revisión y rango, luego elegir horario futuro
GET {{base}}/inquiries/{{inquiry}}/reservation-options
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{base}}/inquiries/{{inquiry}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"quote_id":"{{quote}}","date":"{{slotDate}}","time":"{{slotTime}}","availability_revision":{{availabilityRevision}},"idempotency_key":"{{proposalKey}}"}

### Retención · el prestador acepta el horario en web
GET {{base}}/reservations/{{reservation}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{base}}/reservations/{{reservation}}/checkout-context
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Confirmar la reserva B2 mientras sea elegible · 200, sin pago en flujo normal
PATCH {{base}}/reservations/{{reservation}}/commit
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{reservationVersion}},"idempotency_key":"{{commitKey}}"}

### Avisos · usar source_type y source_id del aviso elegido
GET {{base}}/notifications?per_page=12
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{base}}/notifications/{{noticeSource}}/{{noticeId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
GET {{base}}/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Reseñar tras la realización explícita del servicio en web
POST {{base}}/reservations/{{reservation}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"rating":5,"comment":"El diagnóstico fue claro."}

###
GET {{base}}/services/{{service}}/reviews?page=1
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{base}}/reviews?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

###
PATCH {{base}}/reviews/{{review}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Historial y dashboard al cerrar operativamente la solicitud
GET {{base}}/inquiries?status=completed
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{base}}/reservations?status=completed
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{base}}/me/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Cerrar sesión · el mismo Bearer devolverá 401 en rutas privadas
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Accept: application/json

### Recuperación de contraseña · escenario independiente con entrega habilitada
POST {{base}}/auth/forgot-password
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}"}

###
POST {{base}}/auth/reset-password
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","token":"{{recovery}}","password":"synthetic-new-password","password_confirmation":"synthetic-new-password"}
